post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
hermes-agent ships a read-only PM store of system tools under
/opt/hermes-agent/system-store (node, npm, ffmpeg, ripgrep, python, uv) and
sets HERMES_DISABLE_LAZY_INSTALLS=1. If an older source install left a
partial ~/.hermes/tools/facts.json, remove that file (or the whole tools
dir) once, then retry — the packaged store is the source of truth.
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
